sangati rasayana

  "rasayana-bandha-swarupa ojas-phala dhatu-kriya"
  "rasa-sthita prana-yukta shuddhi-siddha"
  "shiva-mooli-drishthanta kaizen-abheda ananta-sthita"
  "domain-ayurveda-sthita svabhava-swarupa"

  shabda rasayana-bandha, ojas, dhatu, rasa, prana, shuddhi, shiva-mooli, kaizen, ananta, domain-ayurveda, svabhava

done
